NAME: Location

DESCRIPTION:

Displays:
- current location
- location history

Settings menu provides options to:
- Clear location history
- Enable/disable saving of location 
  history
- Download country city-town location 
  database

NOTES:

Two character country codes: 
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_3166-1_alpha-2

Geoapify location database is used.
- https://www.geoapify.com/download-all-the-cities-towns-villages/

